><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Grobbee</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prevalence, Treatment, and Control of Hypertension by Sociodemographic Factors Among the Dutch Elderly</article-title><source>Hypertension</source><year>2000</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>814</fpage><lpage>821</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10720600</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Scheltens</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Bots</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Numans</surname><given-names>ME</given-names></name><name><surname>Grobbee</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoes</surname><given-names>AW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Awareness, treatment and control of hypertension: the &#x02018;rule of halves&#x02019; in an era of risk-based treatment of hypertension</article-title><source>J Hum Hyperten</source><year>2007</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>99</fpage><lpage>106</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/sj.jhh.1002123</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vega</surname><given-names>LS</given-names></name><name><surname>Agusti</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramirez</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><collab>and the investigators of the Tornasol Study</collab></person-group><article-title>Factores de riesgo de las enfermedades cardiovasculares en el Peru (Estudio TORNASOL)</article-title><source>Revista Peruana de Cardiolog&#x000ed;a</source><year>2006</year><volume>XXXII</volume><fpage>82</fpage><lpage>128</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lopez de Guimaraes</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surna